[102.755241, "o", "Lint findings for production-read-only:\r\n\r\n  INFO: command allow pattern '^curl -s (localhost|127\\.0\\.0\\.1).*' allows network downloads (wget/curl) — ensure this is intentional\r\n  INFO: no 'network' rules defined — network access is unrestricted\r\n"]
